        "requires": "|Crota's End Key| AND |Cleared Raid:3| AND (|Banner of War| AND |Strand Unlock| AND |Titan Unlock| AND |The Navigator| AND |Grapple Grenade| AND |Peacekeepers| AND |Pulse Grenade| AND |Touch of Thunder| AND |SMG / Balanced (900RPM)| AND |@Weapons - Sword|)",
