        "requires": "|Vow of the Disciple Key| AND |Cleared Raid:3| AND ((|Shotgun / Pinpoint Slug| OR |Shotgun / Rapid-Fire Slug| OR |Lord of Wolves|) AND (|Divinity| OR |Sniper Rifle / Dynamic (140RPM)| OR |Sniper Rifle / Rapid-Fire| OR |Sniper Rifle / Adaptive| OR |Sniper Rifle / Aggressive|))"
