        "requires": "|Last Wish Key| AND ((|Thunderlord| AND |Storm's Keep| AND |Titan Unlock| AND |Arc Unlock| AND |Stoicism| AND ((|Prismatic Unlock| AND |Facet of Ruin|) OR (|Stasis Unlock| AND |Whisper of Fissures|))) OR (|Thunderlord| AND |Warlock Unlock| AND |Void Unlock| AND |Magnetic Grenade| AND |Contraverse Hold| AND |Chaos Accelerant| AND |Echo of Undermining|))"
    },
